Z||000005||Nashco||11-05-2001||02:23 AM||||First off, I think Honda does something right about 99% of the time they do something.<P>Secondly, I think the Del Sol is a SWEET car.  With some mods they have major potential.  I love the factory targa/rear window setup.<P>Third, what's wrong with front wheel drive?  Every drive configuration has it's benefits.  There are many things a Del Sol would do better at than a Fiero, for example.  Just because it's different doesn't mean it's bad.<P>I'm in love with my Fiero, so don't think I'm saying the Fiero is junk.  I'm just saying the Del Sol has a lot to offer, and in my opinion, no drawbacks.  "Different strokes for different folks."  Do we hassle the Mary Kay lady because she had a great thing going, until she got the pink car?  No, we just let her do her thing...<P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
