Z||000009||firstfiero||11-05-2001||07:04 AM||||   I wouldn't say  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> .....it's scary how realistic that game is. <BR>    I like del sols alot! I probobly like the way they look as much as my fiero. I'd still rather have my fiero for it's sweet v6 growl...and off the line torque. Stock theirs just not enough power. Not to say you couldn't modd it out.... I just don't like the sound of pumped up rice. I didn't realize that the back window was eletric. I thought it popped out. That is sweet! Anything with a targa top rocks.<BR><P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000010||Darren's 87 coupe||11-05-2001||08:18 AM||||i drove one a few months ago.  It was sooooo slow.  It had no speed off the line and no passing power on the highway, the interior I really didn't like at all either.  The exterior is pretty boring as well.  To me it seems like the got the window thing right and then just quit.  I think the gas milage was about the same as a 4cyl fiero.  Just not very impressive at all except the window feature.  That really did kick total a$$, but man does my Fiero feel better all around. My 2 cents.<BR>Darren<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blueman_copy_6.jpg"> ||||reg||1
